   "lines": [
    "Reached Mattawomkeag",
    "about 11 a.m, where",
    "I found Will Seavall",
    "waiting for me in a",
    "sleigh. From there ~~it~~",
    "it is 36 miles to",
    "Island Falls, where",
    "I am now, and it",
    "was nearly ten",
    "when we arrived here.",
    "It was bitterly cold,",
    "but still, and we were",
    "well wrapped up, so",
    "I enjoyed the ride",
    "very much. The road",
    "was hardly broken",
    "out, in places."
   ],
